{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Day With Vanessa"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Shake a Tail Feather "}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About the Future - <span class=\"italic\">If</span>, <span class=\"italic\">When</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Before</span> and <span class=\"italic\">After</span>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use time clauses to give information about time and sequence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the words <span class=\"italic\">If</span>, <span class=\"italic\">When</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Before</span> and <span class=\"italic\">After</span> in time clauses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the first conditional with these time clauses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">If/When/Before/After</span> + Subject + Simple Present tense, Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will/be going to </span>+ Simple Present tense"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Before</span> means at an earlier time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">After</span> means at a later time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Before I go to sleep, I'll set my alarm. <br/>After I set my alarm, I'm going to go to sleep.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">If</span> means on the condition that ..."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">If I go to sleep, I'll set my alarm.</span> (I'm not sure that I'll go to sleep)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">When</span> means at the time of doing something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">When I go to bed, I'll set my alarm.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Before we go, I'll have to lie down."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I decide to go, I'll just meet him there."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you decide on something, I'll pick you up."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Clarification and Emphasizing a Point"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You ask for clarification when it is not clear what the other person is referring to. You ask the other person to be more specific by giving you more information. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Questions within sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions.</span><br/> An embedded question is a question included in another question or statement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example</span>: <br/><span class=\"strong\">Simple question:</span> What are you going to do after dinner?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Embedded question:</span> Do you know what you're going to do after dinner?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I don't know why you would want to dance with me! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you know where this new club is that Peter is talking about? "}, {"type": "example", "content": " Do you remember what the name is?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be buried"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put under ground or many things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My phone is buried in my bag. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob07aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about social activities."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to finish up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to finish"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm just finishing up a picnic lunch with Sally."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob07aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "club"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "short for nightclub; a place to dance"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to check out the new club."}, {"type": "audio